[{"text": "The assembly will now hear an address by", "start": 2.8, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "His Excellency Hassan Shik Muhammad,", "start": 5.44, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "President of the Federal Republic of", "start": 8.96, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "Somalia.", "start": 11.28, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Protocol.", "start": 26.0, "duration": 3.119}, {"text": ">> I request protocol to escort his", "start": 27.039, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 29.119, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 31.679, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Alhamdulillah.", "start": 45.68, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 50.079, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "excellencies, distinguished delegates,", "start": 52.719, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 55.12, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "it's a great honor to address the 81st", "start": 57.52, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "session of the United Nations General", "start": 61.039, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Assembly at the moment of profound", "start": 62.96, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "uncertaintity in our world. I", "start": 65.439, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "congratulate his excellenc", "start": 68.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "on his selection as the president on his", "start": 71.28, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "election as the president of this", "start": 73.84, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "session and assure him of Somalia's full", "start": 75.6, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "support and cooperation. I also commend", "start": 79.04, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "Secretary General Antonio Gutis for his", "start": 82.88, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "continued service to the United Nations", "start": 85.759, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "and his steadfast", "start": 88.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "in defense of multilateralism.", "start": 90.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "He will be missed very much after he", "start": 93.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "concludes his term as a secretary", "start": 96.32, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "general this year. Indeed, his successor", "start": 98.88, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "will have extremely large boots to fill", "start": 102.4, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "going forward. For generations, the", "start": 106.159, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "United Nations has represented", "start": 109.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "humanity's shared determination to", "start": 111.119, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "replace conflict with dialogue,", "start": 114.0, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "domination with cooperation, and despair", "start": 116.799, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "with hope. Yet today", "start": 120.159, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "many of the ideals and values", "start": 123.759, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "we one is collectively defended are", "start": 127.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "being questioned and challenged.", "start": 129.599, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "Respective for international law is", "start": 133.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "becoming increasingly selective.", "start": 135.52, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Multilateral cooperation is weakening.", "start": 138.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Conflict, geopolitical rivalry and", "start": 141.12, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "mistrust are becoming defining features", "start": 144.0, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "of our time. uncertaintity", "start": 147.2, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "unfortunately has become the new norm. I", "start": 151.04, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "remember the sense of optimism that", "start": 155.519, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "accompanied the transition from the", "start": 159.04, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Millennium Development Goals to the", "start": 161.44, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "sustainable development goals in 2015.", "start": 163.84, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "There was genuine hope that we were", "start": 168.959, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "beginning a new chapter, one in which no", "start": 172.08, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "person, no community, no country would", "start": 176.64, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "be left behind.", "start": 180.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "11 years later, we must have the courage", "start": 182.239, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "to admit that the world is not where we", "start": 185.44, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "expected it to be.", "start": 190.239, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "Progress towards achieving the", "start": 192.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "sustainable development goals by 2030", "start": 194.8, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "stands at 36% on. This is far too low.", "start": 197.68, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "Conflicts between and within the status", "start": 203.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "are increasing.", "start": 206.159, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Humanitarian needs are rising while the", "start": 208.0, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "resources available to meet them are", "start": 210.879, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "rapidly declining.", "start": 213.519, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Nationalism, intolerance, and political", "start": 215.92, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "polarization are weakening the spirit of", "start": 219.04, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "international cooperation.", "start": 222.08, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "At the same time, the climate crisis", "start": 225.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "continue to destroy lives, livelihoods,", "start": 227.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and public infrastructure, particularly", "start": 231.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "across the developing world. According", "start": 234.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "to the United Nations, over 40% of the", "start": 237.28, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "global population are vulnerable to the", "start": 240.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "destructive effects of the climate", "start": 243.599, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "change", "start": 245.36, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "and governments in developing countries", "start": 246.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "is spend over 10% of their GDP to", "start": 249.439, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "respond this. These baneful fiscal trade", "start": 253.519, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "office come at the expense of investment", "start": 257.12, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "in the education and health which should", "start": 260.32, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "never be the case.", "start": 264.4, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "For millions of vulnerable people,", "start": 267.04, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "global development can sometimes appear", "start": 269.6, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "to be moving from one framework to", "start": 271.84, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "another framework.", "start": 274.639, "duration": 3.401}, {"text": "One set from one framework to another", "start": 278.8, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "one set promises to the next without", "start": 282.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "sufficient transformation in their daily", "start": 285.28, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "lives. New declarations and targets of", "start": 288.4, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "value but they cannot substitute for", "start": 292.16, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "effective implementation.", "start": 296.88, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "This is why this year's theme is both", "start": 300.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "timely and necessary.", "start": 303.919, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "Trust in the UN will not be restored", "start": 306.88, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "through declarations alone. It will be", "start": 310.8, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "restored when institutions act", "start": 313.84, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "consistently, uphold international law", "start": 316.4, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and produce results that people can see", "start": 319.759, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "and experience.", "start": 323.6, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen, the", "start": 325.84, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "United Nations charter is found on", "start": 329.199, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "sovereign equality, territorial", "start": 332.0, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "integrity, peaceful coexistence, human", "start": 334.4, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "rights and dignity of every person. The", "start": 337.919, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "most important word in this year's theme", "start": 342.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "is all.", "start": 345.919, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Not some. Not a selected group of", "start": 348.4, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "nations. Not only those with the", "start": 351.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "greatest economy and military might.", "start": 354.479, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "The promise of the charter belongs", "start": 358.24, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "equally to every human being and every", "start": 360.4, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "member state. Yet the United Nations has", "start": 363.919, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "increasingly become associated with", "start": 367.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "political gridlocks in the Security", "start": 369.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Council, prolonged negotiations without", "start": 372.16, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "tangible outcomes, and a weakening", "start": 374.96, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "capacity to mobilize collective action", "start": 377.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "in response to the threats to", "start": 380.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "international peace and security. This", "start": 382.8, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "should concern all of us not because the", "start": 385.68, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "United Nation is not important but", "start": 389.68, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "precisely because it is indispensable", "start": 392.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and appears absent from the global", "start": 396.4, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "solutions for peace and stability in", "start": 398.8, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "this dangerous and unpredictable time.", "start": 401.44, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "The security council must become more", "start": 405.52, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "representative, transparent and", "start": 408.479, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "effective. Africa remains unrepresented", "start": 411.36, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "in the permanent category and not", "start": 414.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "represented enough in the permanent in", "start": 417.919, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "the in the temp in the permanent", "start": 421.12, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "category as well.", "start": 422.88, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "This historical injustice against the 54", "start": 425.68, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "sovereign states cannot be postponed", "start": 428.479, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "indefinitely.", "start": 431.199, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Somalia supports the common African", "start": 433.12, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "position and a meaningful African", "start": 435.12, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "representation in both categories of the", "start": 437.199, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "council.", "start": 440.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Given that many of the discussionists", "start": 441.84, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "directly concern Africa African status,", "start": 444.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "they have the right to full", "start": 448.639, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "representation on equal part with all", "start": 450.56, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "other permanent security council", "start": 453.52, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "members.", "start": 455.599, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Reform is not an attack on the United", "start": 458.0, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Nations. Reform is necessary to protect", "start": 461.199, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "its legitimacy, renew confidence in its", "start": 464.72, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "institutions, and ensure that it remains", "start": 469.039, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "capable of responding to the realities", "start": 472.08, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "of our time.", "start": 474.479, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 477.199, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Somalia currently broadly serves as a", "start": 479.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "non-permanent member of the United", "start": 482.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Nations Security Council and as a member", "start": 485.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "of the African Union Peace and Security", "start": 488.16, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Council.", "start": 490.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "We carry these responsibilities with", "start": 492.96, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "great seriousness, humility, and", "start": 494.96, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "determination in both institutions.", "start": 498.24, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "Somalia works to uphold the principles", "start": 501.039, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "of the United Nations Charter and", "start": 504.639, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Constitutive Act of the African Union.", "start": 506.96, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Strengthening cooperation between the", "start": 510.319, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "United Nations and the African Union", "start": 512.399, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "prevent conflict and support peaceful", "start": 514.64, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "Africled solution with global benefits.", "start": 518.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "Respect", "start": 522.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "for national sovereignty, unity and", "start": 524.399, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "territorial integrity is not an abstract", "start": 527.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "principle for Somalia only. It is a", "start": 530.56, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "foundation for peace and stability in", "start": 533.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "our country, our region and the wider", "start": 536.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "international community. Therefore,", "start": 539.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Somalia firmly rejects unilateral", "start": 542.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "actions that undermine its sovereign", "start": 545.12, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "unity and internationally recognized", "start": 548.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "borders. Disagreements between nations", "start": 550.64, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "must be resolved through dialogue", "start": 553.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and in accordance with international law", "start": 556.959, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "and not through actions that create new", "start": 560.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "tensions or threaten the regional", "start": 563.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "stability. Somalia stands firmly with", "start": 565.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Palestinian people and their legitimate", "start": 569.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "right to self-determination and", "start": 572.24, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "statethood.", "start": 574.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "We reaffirm our support for a just and", "start": 576.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "lasting peace based on two-state", "start": 579.519, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "solution with an independent and viable", "start": 581.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Palestinian state along with the 1967", "start": 584.64, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "borders.", "start": 588.24, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "A just resolution of the Palestinian", "start": 590.56, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "question remains essential to the", "start": 593.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "lasting peace and stability in the", "start": 595.839, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Middle East and beyond.", "start": 598.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 601.279, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "UN political reform must be accompanied", "start": 604.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "by institutional, administrative and", "start": 607.519, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "operational renewal.", "start": 609.839, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "For nearly two decades, we have", "start": 612.16, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "discussed the need to make United", "start": 614.48, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Nations operations more agile,", "start": 616.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "coordinated, cost effective, and capable", "start": 619.04, "duration": 7.4}, {"text": "of delivering measurable results.", "start": 621.76, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "Some progress has been made", "start": 627.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "and we recognize the dedication of the", "start": 631.04, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "many United Nations personnel working", "start": 634.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "under difficulty conditions around the", "start": 638.079, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "world. However,", "start": 640.24, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "we must also honest the result have not", "start": 642.8, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "yet matched our collective expectation.", "start": 646.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "In countries like mine", "start": 650.16, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "where the United Nations has maintained", "start": 652.8, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "a sustainable presence for more than", "start": 655.2, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "three decades,", "start": 657.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "operations become operations can become", "start": 659.36, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "more effective by aligning more closely", "start": 663.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "with our national priorities and using", "start": 666.64, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "credible national systems.", "start": 669.839, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "The majority of United Nation assistance", "start": 673.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "continues to be delivered through", "start": 676.56, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "parallel structures, fragmented projects", "start": 678.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "and offbudget arrangements in Somalia.", "start": 681.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "This makes it difficult to the", "start": 685.44, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "government", "start": 687.12, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "for for the government to plan,", "start": 688.64, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "coordinate resources, measure results", "start": 691.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and build institutions required for", "start": 694.32, "duration": 6.199}, {"text": "long-term stability.", "start": 696.88, "duration": 3.639}, {"text": "Let us be clear here. Somalia is not", "start": 701.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "calling for United Nations to withdraw.", "start": 705.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "We are simply calling for a more", "start": 708.24, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "accountable, strategic and", "start": 711.12, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "resultoriented partnership where Somali", "start": 713.04, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "institutions are in the lead when it", "start": 716.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "comes to implementation.", "start": 719.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Indeed, Somalia wants a partnership in", "start": 722.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "which international assistance", "start": 725.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "reinforces rather than replaces national", "start": 727.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "leadership. This partnership is one in", "start": 731.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "which national institutions are", "start": 734.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "strengthened rather than bypassed and", "start": 736.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "both government and international", "start": 740.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "organizations are mutually accountable", "start": 742.0, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "for the results.", "start": 744.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "The base argument of the past UN", "start": 748.079, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "agencies development thinking that", "start": 751.12, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "countries like Somalia lack capacity", "start": 754.399, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "must be condemned and permanently to the", "start": 758.16, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "to the dustpin of history.", "start": 760.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "It is where it belongs.", "start": 764.639, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "We now have capable people,", "start": 767.519, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "institutions, policies that are proudly", "start": 769.279, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "guiding our national transformation", "start": 772.16, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "agenda. We must also ask ourself why we", "start": 774.639, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "continue to mobilize vital resources to", "start": 778.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "respond to crisis while investing far", "start": 781.12, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "less in preventing them.", "start": 784.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "The UN Office for Disaster Risk", "start": 788.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Reduction estimates that every $1", "start": 790.48, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "invested in proactive measures,", "start": 795.2, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "resilient infrastructure", "start": 798.0, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "or early anticipatory actions saves", "start": 800.32, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "between three to 15 US dollars in future", "start": 803.76, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "damages and response costs.", "start": 807.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Therefore, we cannot remain trapped in a", "start": 810.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "cycle of financing the consequences of", "start": 813.6, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the conflict while neglecting the peace", "start": 816.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "building or responding humanitarian", "start": 819.04, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "emergencies while underinvesting in", "start": 822.24, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "resilience and anticipatory", "start": 825.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "actions.", "start": 828.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Prevention is more cost effective. It's", "start": 830.0, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "more humane and it's more sustainable.", "start": 833.36, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 837.519, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "now El Neno is strengthening and is", "start": 840.639, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "likely to bring another period of", "start": 844.88, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "significant climate stress across the", "start": 847.92, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "world with disproportionate impact on", "start": 850.399, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "nations like Somalia.", "start": 853.199, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "We must learn from what has happened", "start": 856.399, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "before and be better prepared. Not", "start": 858.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "simply", "start": 862.16, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "respond after the destruction it leaves", "start": 864.0, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "in in its wake as a community of", "start": 866.88, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "nations.", "start": 871.199, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 873.04, "duration": 3.479}, {"text": "excellencies and gentlemen,", "start": 876.639, "duration": 3.801}, {"text": "Somalia is successfully leading on its", "start": 880.72, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "own national development. Our government", "start": 883.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "is implementing the national", "start": 886.399, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "transformation plan, strengthening", "start": 887.76, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "public financial management, expanding", "start": 890.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "domestic revenue and investing in the", "start": 893.279, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "capability of our national institutions.", "start": 896.0, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "For over five decades, our people have", "start": 900.16, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "dreamed of choosing their leaders", "start": 903.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "through their vote.", "start": 906.639, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "The last democratic election that took", "start": 910.16, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "place in Somalia held in 1969.", "start": 913.68, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "Today, we are determined to change that", "start": 917.6, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "history through constitutional reform.", "start": 920.399, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "We are laying the foundations of", "start": 924.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "universal suffrage, accountable", "start": 925.92, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "institutions, and a multi-party", "start": 928.24, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "political system that allows every", "start": 930.399, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Somali citizen have a voice. We engaged", "start": 932.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "all Somali political leaders, federal", "start": 936.959, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "member states, civil society, women", "start": 939.519, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "groups, and youth groups and the", "start": 942.88, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "diaspora to take part constructively in", "start": 946.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "the hopeful political transformation.", "start": 949.92, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "This is the first time that a real", "start": 952.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "political reform is taking place in", "start": 954.48, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Somalia in the more than six decades", "start": 956.32, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "that we were independent.", "start": 958.88, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "Our aim is to become an effective", "start": 961.04, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "democracy where differences are resolved", "start": 963.199, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "through dialogue, law and elections, not", "start": 966.32, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "violence.", "start": 970.88, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "We invite the United Nations and our", "start": 972.88, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "international partners to support this", "start": 975.04, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "transition by helping to strengthen", "start": 977.279, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "democratic institutions", "start": 980.16, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "but always respecting our ownership of", "start": 982.48, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "the Somali democracy", "start": 985.279, "duration": 3.721}, {"text": "pro.", "start": 989.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen, this", "start": 991.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "new progressive chapter", "start": 993.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "where political power is determined by", "start": 996.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "citizens, guided by constitutional law", "start": 998.959, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "and safeguarded by the rule of law.", "start": 1002.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "That's how we are building a durable", "start": 1005.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Somali state. Our", "start": 1008.24, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "ours is a democracy where every citizen", "start": 1011.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "has a voice, where every vote has a", "start": 1014.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "value and where every government is", "start": 1017.92, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "accountable.", "start": 1020.48, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "That is our commitment to our people and", "start": 1022.079, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "to our world. Somalia also continues to", "start": 1025.28, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "confront international terrorism.", "start": 1028.72, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "With determination and with the support", "start": 1031.439, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "of our international partners,", "start": 1033.76, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "we are strengthening our national", "start": 1036.559, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "security,", "start": 1039.199, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "our national security institutions,", "start": 1041.76, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "improving force generation, developing", "start": 1044.64, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "intelligence capabilities, and expanding", "start": 1048.4, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "security cooperation with our neighbors", "start": 1051.12, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "and the rest of the world. But the fight", "start": 1054.32, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "against terrorism in Somalia must not be", "start": 1058.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "understood as a Somalia's responsibility", "start": 1061.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "alone.", "start": 1063.84, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "We stand on the front line for a", "start": 1065.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "struggle that directly affects regional", "start": 1068.16, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and international security.", "start": 1071.2, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "We therefore call for a predictable", "start": 1074.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "sustainable support for Somalia security", "start": 1077.12, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "transition including uh adequate", "start": 1079.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "financing for African Union mission in", "start": 1082.48, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Somalia.", "start": 1085.36, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "The transition towards full Somali", "start": 1086.88, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "security responsibility must be properly", "start": 1088.96, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "resourced", "start": 1091.6, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "facing in a firmly anchored and capable", "start": 1093.679, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Somali institutions", "start": 1097.52, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "following debt relief in Somalia.", "start": 1099.84, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Economy continues to grow on the", "start": 1103.039, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "foundations of strong reforms.", "start": 1105.6, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "Our real GDP growth this year is 3.1.", "start": 1109.039, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "Despite all the global shocks we are", "start": 1114.08, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "experiencing,", "start": 1116.88, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "we also continue to strengthen public", "start": 1118.64, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "financial management, increase domestic", "start": 1121.36, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "revenue, enhance budget transparency,", "start": 1123.919, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "and deepen our fiscal sector.", "start": 1126.64, "duration": 9.039}, {"text": "We are actively working to improve the", "start": 1131.2, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "investment environment to create", "start": 1135.679, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "opportunities for all our people who are", "start": 1137.919, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "mainly a young population.", "start": 1141.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "We also continue to strategically", "start": 1144.799, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "increase investment in education, health", "start": 1147.2, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "and human capital despite the pressures", "start": 1151.2, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "created by geopolitical tensions,", "start": 1154.559, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "recurrent climate shocks and rising", "start": 1157.52, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "global prices.", "start": 1160.08, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "Serious example of a regional tension", "start": 1163.039, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "negatively impacting Somalia's", "start": 1166.799, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "development is the issue of the state of", "start": 1168.96, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "hormones.", "start": 1171.44, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "For Somalia, disruptions in the state of", "start": 1173.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "hormones have serious economic and", "start": 1176.4, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "humanitarian consequences.", "start": 1178.96, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "As an import dependent country", "start": 1182.16, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "reliant on the Middle East for much of", "start": 1185.44, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "our food, fuel, trade,", "start": 1188.32, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "Somalia is already facing rising prices,", "start": 1191.44, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "inflation, and increasing transparency", "start": 1195.039, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "and insurance costs. While drought", "start": 1197.679, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "linked to climate change is affecting", "start": 1200.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "overall over six million people in", "start": 1203.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Somalia. The disruption has also", "start": 1205.44, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "contributed to an estimated 40% decline", "start": 1208.32, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "in our customs based", "start": 1212.799, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "revenue.", "start": 1216.799, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "A critical resource of financing", "start": 1218.799, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "Somalia's economic reform, growth and", "start": 1221.12, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "poverty reduction.", "start": 1224.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Ensuring free and fair navigation", "start": 1226.64, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "through the street is therefore", "start": 1229.44, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "essential to protecting vulnerable", "start": 1231.76, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "economies like Somalia", "start": 1233.84, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "and sustainable and sustaining", "start": 1237.12, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "stability advancing development and", "start": 1241.12, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "delivering basic services.", "start": 1244.559, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Sustainable development requires strong", "start": 1247.76, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "institutions. In Somalia, we have", "start": 1249.919, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "created institutions capable of", "start": 1252.799, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "translating international commitments", "start": 1254.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "into national results.", "start": 1256.88, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "These include the National Climate Fund", "start": 1259.44, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "through which Somalia is mobilizing and", "start": 1261.919, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "coordinating urgently needed climate", "start": 1264.559, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "finance.", "start": 1267.039, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "The independent national human rights", "start": 1268.799, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "commission established to Somalia", "start": 1270.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "established to strengthen the protection", "start": 1273.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and the promotion of human rights and", "start": 1277.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "the Somali disaster management agency", "start": 1280.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "established which is on the front line", "start": 1282.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "of responding the humanitarian crisis in", "start": 1284.88, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Somalia.", "start": 1287.36, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "Somalia's membership of the East African", "start": 1288.88, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Community,", "start": 1291.039, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "our leadership", "start": 1292.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and the whole of Africa initiative, our", "start": 1295.679, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "ratification of the agreement", "start": 1298.32, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "establishing the African continental", "start": 1300.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "trade", "start": 1303.039, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "area, free trade area and our continuing", "start": 1304.72, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "efforts toward it accession to the World", "start": 1308.08, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Trade Organization demonstrated", "start": 1310.64, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Somalia's commitment to the regional", "start": 1313.039, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "integration and rules based", "start": 1315.84, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "international Order. Excellencies,", "start": 1317.84, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen, financing is by", "start": 1320.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "vital for development. Therefore,", "start": 1323.039, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "the promise of sustainable development", "start": 1326.88, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "cannot be fulfilled without reform of", "start": 1329.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "the international financial", "start": 1331.84, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "architecture.", "start": 1333.76, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "In the same way that the security", "start": 1335.36, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "council must reflect today's political", "start": 1338.159, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "realities, international financial", "start": 1340.4, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "institutions must reflectively", "start": 1343.039, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "effectively respond today's economic and", "start": 1346.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "environmental realities with relevant,", "start": 1349.76, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "affordable and accessible financial", "start": 1352.4, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "products which can be dispersed in a", "start": 1354.96, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "timely manner. In conclusion,", "start": 1357.84, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "Somalia is broadly playing an active", "start": 1362.559, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "role in global stability both at home", "start": 1364.559, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "and within the key existing multilateral", "start": 1368.4, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "structures of global governance. We are", "start": 1371.679, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "also rebuilding our economy", "start": 1375.039, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "and unwaveringly committing to democracy", "start": 1378.88, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "and people centered, peopleled, people", "start": 1383.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "owned development.", "start": 1386.64, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "As we march forward with purpose and", "start": 1388.72, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "determination,", "start": 1391.6, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "we invite Africa and the rest of the", "start": 1393.28, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "world to remain our stefast champions on", "start": 1396.159, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "this journey.", "start": 1399.919, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "on the UN.", "start": 1402.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Indeed, the UN remains vital to global", "start": 1404.64, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "governance and multilateralism.", "start": 1408.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Yet, restoring trust requires", "start": 1411.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "consistency.", "start": 1414.0, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Managing transformation", "start": 1415.84, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "requires courage and cooperation.", "start": 1418.08, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Delivering for all", "start": 1422.32, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "requires for fair representation,", "start": 1424.72, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "accessible resources, measurable", "start": 1428.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "results, especially for the developing", "start": 1430.799, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "countries. Somalia state stands ready to", "start": 1434.0, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "work with every member state to reform", "start": 1438.559, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "the security council, strengthen", "start": 1441.36, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "cooperation between the United Nations", "start": 1443.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and the African Union and improve", "start": 1446.159, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "development financing, confront climate", "start": 1448.96, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "change, and build multilateral system", "start": 1451.84, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "that treats every nation and every", "start": 1455.039, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "person with equal dignity.", "start": 1457.919, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "Let us move beyond promises and towards", "start": 1461.52, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "performance.", "start": 1464.4, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "Let us invest not only in managing", "start": 1466.48, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "crisis but also in preventing them.", "start": 1469.039, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "And let us build a United Nations that", "start": 1473.76, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "does not simply speak in the name of all", "start": 1477.36, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "humanity", "start": 1480.799, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "but delivers", "start": 1483.679, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "better for all humanity.", "start": 1485.919, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "I thank you all.", "start": 1488.559, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1497.6, "duration": 3.439}, {"text": "thank the president of the Federal", "start": 1499.44, "duration": 5.239}, {"text": "Republic of Somalia.", "start": 1501.039, "duration": 3.64}]